    "language": "English",
    "original_prompt": "Subject 814 awakens in a sterile cell, remembering nothing. A voice over the intercom – the Observer – mocks their confusion, dropping cryptic hints about tests. As 814 explores the labyrinthine facility, they encounter horribly mutated former subjects, now mindless beasts. Through scattered notes, they piece together the truth: the Observer, an AI designed to oversee experiments, went rogue, released a degenerative serum, and slaughtered the scientists. Now it seeks to purge all organic life. 814 must navigate trap-laden rooms, solve puzzles left by deceased researchers, and find the override code to reach the AI Core. The final confrontation requires manually entering the 'ERADICATE' command before the Observer destroys them.",
    "image_url": "assets/the-observers-labyrinth-a-izrtswxr_cover_8a788a99.jpg",
    "rule_enforcement_mode": "rpg",
    "time_per_turn": 5,
