      "text_log_content": "If you wake up as 814, listen carefully: The Observer wiped your memory again. Don't let its voice get in your head.\n\nI pried a loose piece of steel from the bed frame and hid a Maintenance Key inside the floor drainage grate. Search the grate to get out of this cell. Whatever happens, reach the AI Core and type the root command to end this nightmare.",
