      "text_log_content": "MAINFRAME SUB-NODE DIAGNOSTIC:\n>> AI CORE BLAST DOOR REQUIRES 6-DIGIT NUMERIC KEY.\n>> PART 1 (FIRST THREE DIGITS): 739\n>> PART 2 (LAST THREE DIGITS): Stored on portable Terminal Fragment B (last detected on maintenance drone/crawler unit in this tunnel).\n\nCombine Part 1 and Part 2 to unlock the eastern AI Core Blast Door.",
